OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with clear spells leading to
OL,7,Fthe likelihood of areas of mist and
OL,8,Ffog developing overnight, particularly
OL,9,Fthrough Cambridgeshire. Light winds.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,11,Ftime of year, but chilly in clearer
OL,12,Fareas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,15,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,16,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Widespread fog likely to
OL,18,Fredevelop overnight. Light winds. Mild
OL,19,Fby day, chilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
